{"t_ms": 1118656, "conversation_id": "v2llm_streaming_retrieve_s050", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Check-in Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nStandard check-in time is 2:00 PM. Guests are required to present a valid government-issued photo ID and the booking confirmation at the reception. A refundable security deposit may be collected during check-in, depending on the room category. Early check-in is subject to room availability and hotel policies. Guests arriving before the standard check-in time may request luggage storage free of charge while waiting for their room.\n", "In-room Safe Instructions\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nEvery room is equipped with an electronic safety locker for storing valuables such as passports, cash, jewelry, and electronic devices. Guests are advised to set a personal PIN while using the safe. The hotel is not responsible for valuables left unsecured outside the in-room safe. For additional assistance, guests may contact the Front Desk.", "Early Check-in Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests may request an early check-in from 11:00 AM onwards. If a room is available and has been prepared by housekeeping, early check-in will be provided free of charge. Requests are processed on a first-come, first-served basis. Guests arriving much earlier may use the hotel's lounge area and luggage storage facility until their room is ready."], "scores": [0.6086577773094177, 0.62745600938797, 0.6457056403160095], "filenames": ["01_checkin_policy.txt", "20_room_safe.txt", "03_early_checkin_free.txt"], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 110, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
